```

# Forecasting

Below is a 3-period-ahead forecast of the French growth rate (for
2026,2027 and 2028) using the AR(2) model we have estimated. The central
forecast is represented along with confidence bands.

```{r Forecast the growth rate of GDP using an AR(2) model}
ar2_gdp %>%
  forecast(h=3) %>%
  autoplot
```
